{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game About Clicking a Button</strong> isn\u2019t just a button.<br>It\u2019s a maze. It\u2019s nonsense. It\u2019s progress. It\u2019s\u2026 well, mostly a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start inside a strange labyrinth that refuses to stay still. With every click, the world grows. <strong>Walls unlock</strong>. Corridors stretch further. The button itself begins to change \u2013 shifting position, teasing you, daring you to keep pressing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s simple. It\u2019s absurd. And it\u2019s way more addictive than it has any right to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Click the Button</strong> \u2013 Obviously. What else did you expect?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Unlock the Labyrinth</strong> \u2013 Buy new walls, expand the maze, and reveal more of the nonsense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Moving Target</strong> \u2013 The button doesn\u2019t always stay put. Keep up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Upgrades &amp; Surprises</strong> \u2013 From useful boosts to ridiculous distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Nonsense Everywhere</strong> \u2013 Expect random humor, strange pop-ups, and things that probably shouldn\u2019t exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964960/extras/ca18d7ece72a437542c259539bfd3e71.poster.avif?t=1755892275\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964960/extras/ca18d7ece72a437542c259539bfd3e71.webm?t=1755892275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964960/extras/ca18d7ece72a437542c259539bfd3e71.mp4?t=1755892275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Why play this?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because deep down\u2026 you need to know what happens after the next click.<br>And the one after that.<br>And the one after that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There\u2019s only one rule:</strong><br>Don\u2019t stop clicking.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964960?t=1755892275","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964960?t=1755892275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964960/680f42b32bf58a0d64b96d0a190fec70623b73cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755892275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964960/680f42b32bf58a0d64b96d0a190fec70623b73cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755892275","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game About Clicking a Button</strong> isn\u2019t just a button.<br>It\u2019s a maze. It\u2019s nonsense. It\u2019s progress. It\u2019s\u2026 well, mostly a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start inside a strange labyrinth that refuses to stay still. With every click, the world grows. <strong>Walls unlock</strong>. Corridors stretch further. The button itself begins to change \u2013 shifting position, teasing you, daring you to keep pressing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s simple. It\u2019s absurd. And it\u2019s way more addictiv